> - Use these primary components:
>   - STM32U575VGT6 in hand-assemblable LQFP100, with SWD, USB 2.0, clocks, reset, decoupling, and 16 MB QSPI flash. The part provides 1 MB flash and up to 786 KB SRAM, replacing the repo’s mixed STM32/RP2040 specification. [ST product information](https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32u575vg.html)
