>   - TCA8418 keypad scanner for an external 5×7 keypad matrix, DRV2605L haptic driver, jog-dial connector, and interrupt pull-ups.
>   - Switchable 2.5 V and 1.0 V accelerator rails, rail test points, current-measurement links, and safe default-off enables.
